---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="About Truong Nguyen — front-end engineer, ex-Ogilvy Vietnam, freelancer."
  image="/images/posts/0C00FE92-34C2-4DF2-99ED-C686A3CDD095.jpeg"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="badge badge-yellow">🙋 Hey there!</span>
      <h1>About <span class="highlight">me</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">I currently a freelancer Front‑end Engineer.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0.5rem;">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
      <figure class="hero-image">
        <img src="/images/posts/0C00FE92-34C2-4DF2-99ED-C686A3CDD095.jpeg" alt="Truong Nguyen" />
      </figure>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>My name is Truong and I'm proud to be Vietnamese with all the delicious Vietnamese foods. I graduated Computer Sciences B.S. degree at San Francisco State University in 2013 and moved to Vietnam for work and living in between 2014 and 2019 and then I moved back to the US.</p>
        <p>While I was in Vietnam, I had been working at Ogilvy Vietnam, the famous digital agency in the area, at the title of Front-end Engineer for more than five years before I decided to work as a Freelancer. 🤫</p>
        <p>For more technical skills, head over my <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/truong-nguyen-dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn profile here</a> for details. And <a href="/contact/">here</a> if you want to say hi. 😄</p>
        <p>Or sneak peek at my <a href="https://truongnguyen.notion.site/e5fb5ef2f8294b1a939d617c1c20e946?v=98b521f37ac04beea42db4fc4276cce3" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Keyboard Showroom</a> ⌨️</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
